  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "OP-1 field guide",
      "notes": "The guide's MIDI table, read by tools/profiles/teenage/read-te-guide.mjs from the page https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-1 as saved on 2026-11-10 (sha256 90f1cdd01f554421c2f3db59eb57b73be1cf8147b9d7b189bc96aa1b8dd01de9). A guide is a live page: a later one may differ. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/teenage/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/teenage/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the guide's table of incoming MIDI control changes, with its printed name, sent as that controller. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The mixer rows answer on the channels of the four mixer tracks (`1 - 4 *`); the rest on any. A synth and a drum sound share controllers 46 - 53: the guide names both, and the profile both in one name.",
    "Left out, the sustain pedal, the wheel and the channel mode messages: CC 64 sustain pedal, CC 123 all notes off."
  ],
